@startuml
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 5

actor Cliente as C
participant API as API
participant Argon2 as A2
database DB as DB
participant Email as ML
participant Blockchain as BC

C -> API: POST /users { email }
API -> A2: argon2.hash(password)
API -> DB: CREATE user (status: PENDING)
API -> BC: anchor(ACCOUNT_INIT)
API -> ML: sendWelcomeEmail(email)
API --> C: 201 { id, email, role }

note right #FFE0E0: Admin aprueba
C -> API: POST /users/:id/approve
API -> DB: CREATE identity (Ed25519 keypair)
API -> BC: anchor(IDENTITY_CREATED, publicKey)
API -> DB: UPDATE user → ACTIVE
API -> A2: argon2.hash(resetToken)
API -> DB: CREATE passwordResetToken
API -> BC: anchor(ACCOUNT_APPROVE)
API -> ML: sendVerifyEmail(link)
API --> C: 200 OK

@enduml
